Package: pswd
Title: Partly Shifted Weibull Distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Piotr", "Sulewski", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "piotr.sulewski@upsl.edu.pl")
Description: Probability density, cumulative distribution, reliability, hazard rate, reversed hazard rate, quantile, random generation, moments, Shannon entropy, and parameter estimation (ML, MPS, OLS, WLS, LAW) for the three-parameter Partly Shifted Weibull Distribution (PSWD).
